{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/74cba58ddc97718432136c239b34ffcd.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/39c9e4de3d27adc1061b8542e5172180.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/39c9e4de3d27adc1061b8542e5172180.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/39c9e4de3d27adc1061b8542e5172180.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Elevate your prestige by decorating your home with <strong>100 unique decor items</strong>. Reflect your personal style with paintings, furniture, and decorative accessories. Both market and home decorations directly influence your <strong>in-game prestige system !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/31f8a56f03bb0af6a0ae0c33ba576965.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e18305fdafc8eb5a45913c54489bf5e3.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e18305fdafc8eb5a45913c54489bf5e3.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e18305fdafc8eb5a45913c54489bf5e3.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Diversify your earnings by offering <strong>73 different products</strong> for sale. Showcase various product categories to expand your customer base and achieve <strong>maximum revenue potential</strong> through smart product placement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/279cf9e0cae5d923b9e289913dde392b.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/382ae7cfe079744e510eca8e9ec45bd6.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/382ae7cfe079744e510eca8e9ec45bd6.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/382ae7cfe079744e510eca8e9ec45bd6.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Explore your game\u2019s dynamics with countless weather events across <strong>4 distinct seasons.</strong> Effects like <strong>snow, rain, and scorching heat</strong> can change everything from farming to trading. Each season brings <strong>new opportunities and challenges</strong>, injecting vibrancy into your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/03183eb6fd247eab07ba78666690cf9c.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/4440e9bab5e7fdc88811629f776f6032.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/4440e9bab5e7fdc88811629f776f6032.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/4440e9bab5e7fdc88811629f776f6032.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Diversify your farming by cultivating <strong>47 different products.</strong> Optimize processes such as <strong>seeding, irrigation, and harvesting</strong> to achieve <strong>maximum yield.</strong> Sell your crops at the markets for income or use them in various recipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/c4264b4fb58b7c52e0e592f7af8d0695.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e7b7507858dfc29b8cf869a6650727f4.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e7b7507858dfc29b8cf869a6650727f4.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e7b7507858dfc29b8cf869a6650727f4.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Enhance your game with events that occur on different dates. Whether tied to seasonal changes or special occasions, these events offer <strong>rare rewards and surprise opportunities.</strong> Stay active so you never miss out on any advantages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/b5c1b643fe6e6d903ff029e4e0fdbd55.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Obtain various products like <strong>milk, wool, eggs, and meat</strong> by raising <strong>3 different animal species.</strong> Increase your productivity by taking care of your <strong>animals\u2019 health and happiness.</strong> Sell the products you collect to generate income or incorporate them into your own production processes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e38b735bdf19da897344df27afa92c65.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/1e97fb94a40962c103f3f75b80ef5bb6.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/1e97fb94a40962c103f3f75b80ef5bb6.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/1e97fb94a40962c103f3f75b80ef5bb6.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Shape your in-game relationships by completing tasks assigned by the <strong>kingdom, pirates, and the public.</strong> Each task has its own <strong>unique story and reward.</strong> These missions allow you to explore new regions and experience different narratives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/bc25e37e1887dd92ac5d686b3fcca60a.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/6348803deb6169bbc8f3d83c9936f845.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/6348803deb6169bbc8f3d83c9936f845.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/6348803deb6169bbc8f3d83c9936f845.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 The choices you make in missions affect your relationships with the kingdom or other groups. Depending on your relationship level, different events and opportunities are triggered. Make <strong>strategic decisions</strong> to <strong>shape the world and narrative</strong> in the direction you desire!<