er <strong>rare rewards and surprise opportunities.</strong> Stay active so you never miss out on any advantages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/b5c1b643fe6e6d903ff029e4e0fdbd55.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.webm?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/edbbc3edced32bf87b9195032cf68b2c.mp4?t=1761647377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Obtain various products like <strong>milk, wool, eggs, and meat</strong> by raising <strong>3 different animal species.</strong> Increase your productivity by taking care of your <strong>animals\u2019 health and happiness.</strong> Sell the products you collect to generate income or incorporate them into your own production processes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/e38b735bdf19da897344df27afa92c65.avif?t=1761647377\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/1e97fb94a40962c103f3f75b80ef5bb6.poster.avif?t=1761647377\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=